{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Droppp 是一款專為 iPhone 和 iPad 設計的本地 Wi-Fi 檔案傳輸應用，當 AirDrop 無法使用或不想將資料上傳至雲端時，它是理想的替代方案。只要裝置連接到同一個 Wi-Fi 網路，用戶即可透過瀏覽器無需安裝額外桌面程式，直接將照片、影片及文件拖放到網頁上傳送至行動裝置，並能在 App 內進行查看、分享與整理。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-19.webp\">\n<h2>本地無線傳輸與智能管理</h2>\n<p>這款工具讓跨平台檔案交換變得極簡且私密，完全不需要帳號或登入過程。用戶可建立具名稱的資料夾甚至巢狀結構，輕鬆歸類收到的內容，並支援批次選擇檔案移動至其他相容 App。此外，歷史洞察功能協助回顧近期傳輸記錄，確保所有數據僅在本地網路流動，兼顧效率與隱私安全，非常適合需要頻繁從 Windows PC 或 Android 裝置匯入工作文件的專業人士。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-22.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-23.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-24.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-25.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-26.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-27.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Droppp – Local Wi-Fi File Drop</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T07:21:29.381481+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":423,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T07:07:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T23:18:14.829671+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T07:17:41.726496+00:00","content_hash":"b200c87927d4e92b253a112b6c53109265e1b2e9543297ff3b62741657f160af","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}